From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: matthane <matthan.evans@icloud.com>
Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 22:15:58 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] inputstream.adaptive.canary: bake the patched add-on into the
 image

inputstream.adaptive keeps one session state per process, so Kodi cannot
open the next playlist item while the current one plays. The canary carries
the add-on patches that make the state per instance, as an image add-on
whose version is above the repository's.
